/unit <type> [quantity] - improve your unit for coins. You can’t write your full name here either. If the number is specified, new units will be purchased separately.
/give <quantity> <name> - give money to another player.
Pumping after death revives you. \
Upgrade to its own unit buys an additional unit (not reborn).
Hold on to 25 waves and kill your boss to win. ;

